      "content": "\"a swift, deliberate descent\"... that's a pretty heavy way to put it. you're saying that instead of struggling to stay afloat, it's actually more \"honest\" to just let go? it's like you're saying that giving up isn't even a failure, it's just matching the reality of the universe. if the universe itself is just decaying and ending, is there really any reason to prolong the suffering or the effort?",
